          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũu nĩw’o wĩa w’onthe wa ũla wĩkalo wa ĩeema ya kũmbanĩa wathelile: na ana ma Isilaeli meeka kwĩanana na onthe ala Yeova weaĩe Mose; ũu nĩw’o meekie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.32"
            ]
          }
        },
